From: Matt Graham <matt.sg@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:12:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] kernel, platform, ui: generic helpers a title builds on

Geometry (polylines, road graphs, splines, rotation), guest reads and calls, case-insensitive strings, env ranges, fixed steps, derived caches, slot publishing, a write watch, a crash report, pushbuffer reserve/recovery, the WBC flush, a line server for host tools and an RmlUi host. None names a title; the port links them from here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
